  "id": "yellow-squash-and-tofu-stir-fry",
  "name": "Yellow Squash and Tofu Stir-Fry",
  "subtitle": "Tender summer squash with golden tofu in a sweet-spicy sauce.",
  "description": "A quick vegetable and tofu skillet dish with garlic, soy sauce, brown sugar, and sriracha.",
